      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1006*．先代入 $x$ 与 $y$，再变换成标准形式的多项式：",
        "$2xy(x^2+y^2)$，其中 $x=1+\\frac{1}{2}ab,\\ y=1-\\frac{1}{2}ab$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1007",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1007．证明，下列等式是恒等式：",
        "а) $(kx+ky)^2=k^2(x+y)^2$；",
        "б) $(a^2+b^2)(c^2+d^2)=(ac+bd)^2+(ad-bc)^2$；",
        "в) $(2a+b)^2+b^2=2(a^2+(a+b)^2)$；",
        "г) $a^2+b^2=2\\left[\\left(\\frac{a+b}{2}\\right)^2+\\left(\\frac{a-b}{2}\\right)^2\\right]$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1008",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1008．下列各式的值是不是与 $x$ 有关？",
        "а) $(x+7)^2+(5-x)(x+19)$；",
        "б) $(x-9)^2-[(5x-3)(x-4)-(2x-1)^2]$；",
        "в) $(6x-1)^2-[(10x+3)(10x-3)-(8x+1)^2]$；",
        "г) $[(x+4)^2-(x-5)^2]^2-4(x-3)(x+10)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1009",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1009．求值：",
        "а) $(2y-c)^2+(y+2c)^2$，当 $c=1.2,\\quad y=-1.4$ 时；",
        "б) $(3a-2b)^2-(2a-b)^2$，当 $a=1.35,\\ b=-0.65$ 时．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1010",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1010*．一个数被 5 除余 1，另一个数被 5 除余 2．这两个数",
        "的平方和能不能被 5 整除？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1011",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1011*．一个数被 13 除余 2，另一个数被 13 除余 3．这两个",
        "数的平方和能不能被 13 整除？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1012",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1012．解方程：",
        "а) $(x+7)^2+(x-24)^2=(x-25)^2$；",
        "б) $(x+24)^2+(x-10)^2=(x+26)^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1013",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "1013．解方程组：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=(x+4)^2+(y-8)^2,↵\\\\x+y=35.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
